      "desc:8": "§6Machine type: §aAltar of Blood / Alchemic Chemistry Set / Ritual of Binding§r\n\nAfter years of researching, you finally find the last piece to mass-produce the Blood Magic things!\nResearches show that the speed of soaking ritual is highly related to the greatness of the altar and the runes it used.\nAnd there is a small text on the corner said, \"Speed Runes can be the key.\"\nAlso a weird stranger told you that Armok splashes Blood everywhere in the machine.\n\n[note]Hatches[/note]: Input Bus, Input Hatch, Output Bus\n[note]Structure[/note]: the casings in the optional task.\nUse a Hologram Projector (or the NEI structure preview) to see and auto-build the structure.\n\n[note]Controller recipe[/note]: Thaumcraft Infusion\nResearch: Bloody Hell (Thaumonomicon, TST tab).\n - block Master Stone\n - Activation Crystal\n - 3x Amorphic Catalyst\n - Block Altar\n - Block Writing Table",
